# Build artifacts
**/target/
**/.cargo/
**/node_modules/

# Local env / temp files
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# Tracked sample files must stay in the build context: excluding a tracked
# file makes in-container `git describe --dirty` see a deletion, which stamps
# release binaries with a spurious `-modified` version suffix.
!**/.env.*.example
!**/.env.local.example
**/.DS_Store
**/tmp/
**/coverage/

# IDE / tooling caches
.vscode/
.trunk/
